@@ -15,3 +15,18 @@ The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Navigation cache
+
+The client router retains up to five recently visited views, including the active
+view. Inactive views use `content-visibility: hidden`, `inert`, and `aria-hidden`
+to preserve their DOM and component state while skipping rendering and interaction.
+Browsers without `content-visibility` fall back to `display: none`.
+
+Routes are keyed by pathname and query string; fragments share a view. Astro still
+fetches navigation responses and manages titles, history, and scroll restoration.
+Revisiting a retained view reuses its content and local state until eviction or a
+full reload. The least recently used view is removed when the limit is exceeded.
+Sign-in and sign-up use `cacheView={false}` to discard form state on departure.
+
+Run `pnpm test` for automated DOM tests and `pnpm build` for the production build.
